        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>各省车牌代码对照（接上图）</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 8px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: #1fd18a;\n  }\n  .card {\n    background: #d9f2fa;\n    border-radius: 22px;\n    padding: 18px 16px 26px 16px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .lead {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    color: #111111;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 2px;\n  }\n  h2 {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #2b7fd4;\n    margin: 22px 0 10px 2px;\n  }\n  h2:first-of-type {\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  p.body {\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    color: #111111;\n    margin: 0 2px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">接上图</p>\n\n    <h2>云南省(云)省会:昆明</h2>\n    <p class=\"body\">河，云H:文山，云:普洱，云K:西双版纳，云L:大理，云M:保山，云N:德宏，云P:丽江，云Q:怒江，云R:迪庆，云S:临沧</p>\n\n    <h2>陕西省(陕)省会:西安</h2>\n    <p class=\"body\">陕A:西安，陕B:铜川，陕C:宝鸡，陕D:咸阳(除杨陵区)，陕E:渭南，陕F:汉中，陕G:安康，陕H:商洛陕:延安，陕K:榆林，陕U:西安(增补)，陕V:咸阳市杨凌区</p>\n\n    <h2>甘肃省(甘)省会:兰州</h2>\n    <p class=\"body\">甘A:兰州，甘B:嘉峪关，甘C:金昌，甘D:白银甘E:天水，甘F:酒泉，甘G:张掖，甘H:武威甘J:定西，甘K:陇南，甘L:平凉，甘M:庆阳甘N:临夏，甘P:甘南</p>\n\n    <h2>辽宁省(辽)省会:沈阳</h2>\n    <p class=\"body\">辽A:沈阳，辽B:大连，辽C:鞍山，辽D:抚顺，辽E:本溪，辽F:丹东，辽G:锦州，辽H:营口，辽J:阜新，辽K:辽阳，辽L:盘锦，辽M:铁岭，辽N:朝阳，辽P:葫芦岛</p>\n\n    <h2>黑龙江省(黑)省会:哈尔滨</h2>\n    <p class=\"body\">黑A:哈尔滨，黑B:齐齐哈尔，黑C:牡丹江，黑D:佳木斯，黑E:大庆，黑F:伊春，黑G:鸡西，黑H:鹤岗，黑J:双鸭山，黑K:七台河，黑L:哈尔滨所属县及县级市(原松花江地区)，黑M:绥化，黑N:黑河，黑P:大兴安岭地区